  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Arcforge Players Compendium</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Tinker sphere ((computation) package), Adaptable Transfer.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may transfer routines you create into unwilling mechanoids and robots or gizmos and technological items wielded by other creatures. Such targets are allowed a Will save against your gizmo save DC to prevent the transfer, with the wielder of the item or gizmo attempting the save for their equipment.</p>\n<p>Whenever you successfully make a melee attack or melee sunder attempt against a target you could transfer a routine into, you may attempt to transfer a routine from yourself or an item in your possession to the target as an immediate action.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gizmo-feats#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
